'''Wugtrio ex''' (Japanese: '''ウミトリオex''' ''Umitrio ex'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 1 {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} expansion.

